001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          TRPTACC.
001300 AUTHOR.              KURT MOVSESIAN.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.       MAR 4,1981.
003200 DATE-COMPILED.
003400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
003500 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
003600 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  AS-400.
003700 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  AS-400.
      *REMARKS.
      *D   *******************************************************
      *D   *   REPORT -- R 13                                    *
      *D   *   VALID ACCOUNTING LISTING                          *
      *D   *                                                     *
      *D   *   CALLED FROM TRSCREEN - JCW 25                     *
      *D   *   USES ZRSCREEN, FORM FACCRPT                       *
      *D   *                                                     *
      *D   *******************************************************
      *C
      *C  2-9-93  BK DISMUKES  REQUEST 6233
      *C    UPDATED TO REPORT COMPANY, PRIME AND ACCOUNTING CLASS
      *C    CODES.  WILL ALSO REPORT DEPARTMENT WITH COMPANY & PRIME
      *C    LINKS.
      *C
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  11/28/1994  CA ZUBEK
      *C   INCREASED SIZE OF BAD-CODE TABLE.  PROGRAM BLEW UP IN GADSDEN
      *C   DUE TO LIMITED TABLE SIZE ON 11/22/1994.
      *C
      *C  11/29/1994   DAVE PLUM
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO SKIP OVER RECORDS IN DATASET MVALIDPLTDATA
      *C   WHICH HAVE "RC" AS THE FIRST 2 CHARACTERS OF THEIR KEY.  THESE
      *C   RECORDS ARE USED BY THE ELECTRONIC REQUISITION SYSTEM FOR
      *C   REQUESTING (R) AND CHARGE (C) DEPARTMENTS.  THEY ARE
      *C   ADDED/MODIFIED/DELETED BY PROGRAM TEASETUP.  PRIOR TO THIS
      *C   CHANGE, THESE RECORDS WERE BEING INCLUDED ON THE "INVALID
      *C   CLASS CODES" REPORT.  (GADSDEN 11/28/1994)
      *C
      *C
      *C  05/02/2002  CA YODER
      *C   CHANGED WORDING OF HEADINGS ON VALID NEW WORK NUMBER
      *C   REPORT.  FOR SAP PLANTS, THESE ARE REFERRED TO AS
      *C   SAP INTERNAL ORDER NUMBERS.
      *C
003800 SPECIAL-NAMES.  C01 IS NEW-PAGE.
004000
004100 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
004200 FILE-CONTROL.
004300     SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
004400     SELECT SORT-MVALIDPLT-FILE  ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
004400     SELECT SORT-MCLASS-FILE  ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
